development.question_text:
The paired dot plots show germination times.
Both have mode $4$.
Which bed has the greater range, and by how much?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large},scale=0.78]
\draw[->] (-0.5,0)--(8.8,0); \draw[->] (-0.5,2.3)--(8.8,2.3); \foreach \x in {0,...,8} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {$\x$}; \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,2.3) {$\x$};}
\foreach \x/\c in {2/1,3/2,4/5,5/2,6/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{0.32*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}}
\foreach \x/\c in {1/1,3/2,4/4,6/2,8/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{2.3+0.32*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}}
\node[left] at (-0.55,0.8) {Bed A}; \node[left] at (-0.55,3.1) {Bed B}; \node[below] at (4.5,-0.9) {Days};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

